WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.660
Manon deliberately whiffs standing heavy punch as Ryu rises from the corner knockdown.

2
00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:01.050
Crouching light kick hits Ryu low on wake-up.

3
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.770
Standing light punch continues the low confirm.

4
00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:02.850
Medium Dégagé strikes Ryu in the corner.

5
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:03.850
Ryu falls from medium Dégagé while Manon recovers.
